#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Standalone, bounded MotionBGS adapter for Wall-in-One.

The program is intentionally one-shot.  It accepts a small schema-1 request,
performs at most the network work required by that request, writes one bounded
schema-1 response without replacing an existing path, and exits.  It never
logs in, executes site JavaScript, or attempts to bypass an access challenge.
"""

